tyle=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Fira code&amp;quot;, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: italic; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b5b5b5&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;1. 收集key和ref,需要判断key和ref是不是合法的&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Fira code&amp;quot;, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b5b5b5&quot; style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;2. 收集children,可以是React Element对象或数组&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Fira code&amp;quot;, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b5b5b5&quot; style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;3. 收集props,函数组件和类组件可能还有&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(239, 89, 111); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;defaultProps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Fira code&amp;quot;, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace, Consolas, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 18px; line-height: 24px; white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b5b5b5&quot;&gt;4. 调用ReactElement返回React Element对象&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
